---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'PrometheusFC Privacy Policy · CODEDNA';
const description =
  'How PrometheusFC collects, uses and shares personal information, and the choices you have.';
const contactEmail = 'prometheusfc@c0dedna.com';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} path="/apps/prometheusfc/privacy">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container-page">
      <p class="micro">Apps / PrometheusFC / Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="text-h1 hero__title">PrometheusFC Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="effective">Effective date: October 8, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="legal">
    <div class="container-page legal__inner">
      <p>
        PrometheusFC ("PrometheusFC", "we", "us") is a football predictions app operated by
        <strong>C0DEDNA LLC</strong>, a Texas limited liability company, United States, that
        builds apps and provides IT consulting, cloud computing and artificial intelligence
        services. This policy covers PrometheusFC only; C0DEDNA's other apps have their own
        policies. It explains what personal information we collect when you use the PrometheusFC
        app, our website and our beta-tester sign-up form, how we use it, who we share it with,
        and the choices you have.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have a question about this policy or your information, contact us at
        <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>

      <h3>Information you give us</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Account details:</strong> your full name, email address, phone number, country,
          and a password. We store your password only in hashed form; we never see or store it in
          plain text.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Profile choices:</strong> your favourite team, avatar frame and similar display
          settings.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Prize-league details:</strong> if you join a prize league and request a payout,
          the email address of your PayPal account.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Beta sign-up details:</strong> if you sign up to test the app through our
          sign-up form, your first and last name, email address, phone number, country and the
          platform you use (iPhone or Android).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Messages you send us:</strong> feedback and support requests, and anything you
          include in them.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Information created when you use the app</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Your activity:</strong> the picks you track, the parlays you build, your virtual
          bankroll, quiz answers and scores, XP, coins, streaks, achievements, friends, battles,
          groups and favourites.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Device and notification identifiers:</strong> push-notification tokens (Firebase
          Cloud Messaging) and, on iPhone, Live Activity tokens, so we can send match alerts and
          live score cards to your device.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage information:</strong> in-app events such as opening the app, the screens
          you visit and the app version you use.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Crash and diagnostic reports:</strong> technical information about crashes and
          errors (Firebase Crashlytics).
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        <strong>Information we do not collect:</strong> we do not collect your precise location,
        contacts, photos, or payment card details.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          to create and run your account and provide the app's features (picks, parlays, the
          virtual bankroll, the quiz, leaderboards, friends, battles and groups);
        </li>
        <li>
          to send you match alerts, live score cards and other notifications you can turn off in
          your device settings;
        </li>
        <li>
          to help you recover your account (we send password-reset codes by email or push
          notification);
        </li>
        <li>to run prize leagues and pay prizes to winners;</li>
        <li>
          to invite beta testers to TestFlight (iPhone) or Firebase App Distribution (Android),
          and to communicate about the beta;
        </li>
        <li>to keep the app secure, prevent fraud and cheating, and enforce our rules;</li>
        <li>
          to understand how the app is used, fix problems and improve the app and its predictions;
        </li>
        <li>to comply with the law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for third-party
        advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>3. What other users can see</h2>
      <p>
        Other PrometheusFC users can see your display name, avatar, and your results on
        leaderboards, in battles and in groups you join. Your email address, phone number and
        PayPal email are never shown to other users.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Who we share information with</h2>
      <p>
        We share personal information only with service providers that help us run PrometheusFC,
        under agreements that limit how they may use it:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Cloud:</strong> hosting, our database and backups (servers in the United
          States);
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Firebase:</strong> notifications (Cloud Messaging), usage analytics
          (Analytics), crash reports (Crashlytics) and Android beta distribution (App
          Distribution);
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Workspace, Google Forms and Google Sheets:</strong> email delivery and our
          beta sign-up form;
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Apple:</strong> iPhone notifications, Live Activities and TestFlight beta
          distribution;
        </li>
        <li><strong>PayPal:</strong> prize payouts, only for users who request one.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The football data and odds providers we use receive no personal information about you.</p>
      <p>
        We may also disclose information if required by law, to protect the rights, safety or
        property of our users or others, or as part of a merger, acquisition or sale of assets,
        in which case this policy will continue to apply.
      </p>

      <h2>5. How long we keep information</h2>
      <p>We keep your account information and activity for as long as your account is open.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>When you delete your account in the app,</strong> your account and the
          information tied to it are deleted straight away.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>When you ask us by email,</strong> we delete it within 30 days.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>What we keep after a deletion:</strong> weekly prize-league results (the week,
          the position, the XP and any prize) without your name, email or phone; for a prize that
          was paid, its date, amount and PayPal payment reference, for tax and accounting
          purposes.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage analytics and crash reports</strong> are kept by Google for up to 14
          months. Deleting your account stops the app linking any further data to you; data
          already collected stays with Google, under an account number that no longer leads to
          you, until Google's retention period ends.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Beta sign-up details</strong> are kept until the beta ends or you ask us to
          remove them.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live, you may have the right to ask for access to your personal
        information, to correct it, to delete it, to object to or restrict how we use it, or to
        receive a copy of it. You can:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>edit your profile details in the app;</li>
        <li>turn off notifications in your device settings;</li>
        <li>
          <strong>delete your account</strong> in the app under <strong>Profile → Delete
          account</strong>, or by emailing <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
          {' '}from the email address on your account.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We will respond to requests within 30 days. If you are in <strong>Kenya</strong>, you have
        the rights given by the Data Protection Act, 2019, and may complain to the Office of the
        Data Protection Commissioner. If you are in the European Economic Area or the United
        Kingdom, you may complain to your local data protection authority.
      </p>

      <h2>7. International transfers</h2>
      <p>
        PrometheusFC is operated from the United States, and our servers are in the United States.
        If you use the app from elsewhere, including Kenya, your information is transferred to and
        processed in the United States. We rely on our service providers' safeguards for these
        transfers.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Security</h2>
      <p>
        We protect your information with encryption in transit (HTTPS), hashed passwords and
        restricted access to our systems. No system is perfectly secure, so please use a strong
        password that you do not use elsewhere.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Age limit</h2>
      <p>
        PrometheusFC is intended for people aged <strong>18</strong> and over, because it involves
        betting odds and prize contests. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone
        under that age. If you believe a child has given us information, contact us and we will
        delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy. If we make significant changes, we will tell you in the app or
        by email before they take effect. The effective date at the top shows when it was last
        changed.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        C0DEDNA LLC, Texas, United States<br />
        <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 6.5rem) clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .hero__title {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .effective {
    margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-micro);
    letter-spacing: var(--text-micro--letter-spacing);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-faint);
  }

  .legal {
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 46rem;
    text-align: justify;
    hyphens: auto;
  }

  .legal__inner > * + * {
    margin-block-start: 1.15em;
  }

  .legal__inner h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    line-height: var(--text-h2--line-height);
    letter-spacing: var(--text-h2--letter-spacing);
    margin-block-start: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    padding-block-start: 1.25rem;
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .legal__inner h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    line-height: var(--text-h3--line-height);
    letter-spacing: var(--text-h3--letter-spacing);
    margin-block-start: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .legal__inner ul {
    padding-inline-start: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .legal__inner a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
</style>
